       "tex": "\\kPcm = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(\\kpcm_1 + \\kpcm_2),\\quad \\kpcm = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(\\kpcm_2 - \\kpcm_1)",
